RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Barry County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 32% of normal in November to December and 54% in July to August. Grid 19644 had its driest year in 1963 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
